痛いよ 前向きなうそ まに受けるのは
It hurts to take positive lies at face value

142
00:19:37,024 --> 00:19:40,024
笑っている恋人がいないから
Since there's no smiling lover around

143
00:19:41,024 --> 00:19:45,024
見えない もてあました 今すぐほめて
Invisible, having too much time on my hands, praise me right now

144
00:19:46,024 --> 00:19:50,024
すぐそばに
Right by my side

145
