[Text: First-ever casual location vlog]

461
01:00:03,496 --> 01:00:04,496
うわーー!
Whoa—!

462
01:00:06,336 --> 01:00:07,536
頬張りすぎた…
I stuffed my cheeks too much...

463
01:00:08,296 --> 01:00:10,596
[Text: まさかの洞窟探検!?]
[Text: Could it be cave exploration!?]

464
01:00:12,616 --> 01:00:16,896
AZKi初めてのロケに行ってきました! 乞うご期待!!
I went on my very first location vlog! Stay tuned!!

465
01:00:21,416 --> 01:00:24,516
今日はAZKiの5周年ライブに来てくれてありがとう。
Thank you for coming to AZKi's 5th anniversary live today.

466
01:00:24,916 --> 01:00:27,616
新衣装どうだったかな? 似合ってたかな?
How was the new outfit? Did it suit me?

467
01:00:28,016 --> 01:00:32,016
5周年はAZKiにとって、大きな節目の年だと思っています。
I believe the 5th anniversary is a major milestone year for AZKi.

468
01:00:32,416 --> 01:00:37,516
開拓者のみんながいなかったら、今日この日を迎えることはありませんでした。
If it weren't for all you Pioneers, I wouldn't have been able to reach this day.

469
01:00:37,916 --> 01:00:40,516
素敵な景色を見せてくれてありがとう。
Thank you for showing me such wonderful scenery.

470
01:00:41,116 --> 01:00:46,516
「with U」あなたがいるから、AZKiがここにいるよ。
"with U" Because you are here, AZKi is here.

471
01:00:46,916 --> 01:00:49,316
6年目もよろしくね。
Please look after me in my 6th year too.

